# Always work on master

- **Always** check out and work on `master` for this repo.
- **Never** check out `cursor/forgot-password-page` unless the user explicitly asks.
- If you find yourself on `cursor/forgot-password-page` (or any agent/tool switches you there), switch back to `master` immediately.
- Prefer merging needed work into `master` over continuing development on that feature branch.
